error[E1300]: the type Plain cannot be proxied
  --> $DIR/proxy-class.nra:11:29
   |
11 | let make = func -> Plain => proxies.create<Plain>(new Handler());
   |                             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ only an interface can be proxied
   |
   = help: proxy an interface whose requirements are non-generic instance methods

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E1300`.
